+// Swiftra: the upstream explanation paragraphs state that "Google Safe
+// Browsing recently found" the threat and link to Google's transparency report
+// and Safe Browsing error-report form. In a non-Google-branded build the
+// verdict normally comes from Swiftra Shield (local list), so that sentence
+// would be false. Leave it out; the details section still shows the
+// translated finalParagraph (risk warning plus the proceed link).
+std::u16string ExplanationParagraph(int message_id) {
+#if BUILDFLAG(GOOGLE_CHROME_BRANDING)
